{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1548979200, "end_date": 1549670399, "month_true_total": 62, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:52:04 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "48852414", "author": {"steamid": "76561198097449821", "personaname": "Venom_Veronica", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198097449821/", "num_games_owned": 172, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 1573, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 421, "last_played": 1582920334, "avatar": "70aee9c8a09b5b78b60994bf3c4ae077d7c62f8c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "萌新旷工前来报道~怪是什么？我的眼里只有矿~", "timestamp_created": 1549649040, "timestamp_updated": 1549649040, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48845204", "author": {"steamid": "76561198402656413", "personaname": "vivien", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/919651706/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 366, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 247, "last_played": 1550912021, "avatar": "b3b701a0c8c60d2a81cede6fc60db7e29ff4df8a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "        和我哥们儿玩还是蛮有意思的，但是老是在跟骡子跑路的时候骡子突然飞檐走壁溜了，留下我俩被怪淹死……好几次险些自闭，不知道有没有同学要加入我们一起当苦工的（以上为表面评论，接下来是内心OS）\n        通过这个游戏我体验到了被资本家剥削的矿工们的痛苦生活，玩这个游戏死了两次之后，我的内心已经麻木，和哥们儿的语音也经常静默，两人成为被异化的劳动力，木偶般的挖洞、打怪、寻找目标矿物。而万恶的老板可能正在飞船的雷达室内边喝啤酒边看雷达上两个微弱的绿色光点，只有偶尔红色光点密集出现时才会发出一些警告，当我们带着屡次劫后余生的麻木心情返回飞船，摘下面罩擦着湿成一团的头发时，老板无耻的拿走矿石，并将售价所得的九成拿走，只留下一成给这些可怜的苦工。\n       仇恨已经在内心埋下了种子，希望接下来工作室能出这款游戏的续作，名字我都想好了——Deep Rock Galactic：Revolution", "timestamp_created": 1549629007, "timestamp_updat